      <span class="story-piece">✨ NEW POINT · Notice the three reflection patterns: 지금까지 열심히 <b>노력해 왔어요</b> (have been working hard — -아/어 오다), 그 <b>김에</b> 돌아봐요 (while at it — -(으)ㄴ/는 김에), and 좋은 경험인 <b>셈치고</b> 넘어가요 (count as — -(으)ㄴ/는 셈치고). Together they tell the story of how far you've come!</span>
