      <div class="d-bubble"><div class="who">유나</div><div class="ko">사실 의외로 쉬운 게 아니라, 우리가 그만큼 준비를 잘했던 거예요. 자신 있어요! 화이팅!</div><div class="gl">Actually, it wasn't that it was unexpectedly easy — we just prepared that well. I'm confident! Fighting!</div></div>
