{ "cls": "practice", "html": `<div class="practice">
  <div class="p-head"><span class="p-badge">TOPIK TYPE</span><span class="p-title">[90-10] Reading — 유산의 뜻</span></div>
  <div class="p-dir">Choose the correct meaning.</div>

  <div class="p-q"><span class="pt-ko">지훈: 유산은 그냥 물건이 아니라, 다음 세대가 기억하는 우리의 이야기와 음악이에요.</span> What does Jihun say a legacy is?</div>
  <div class="opts" data-q="6a90q10">
      <button class="opt" onclick="checkQ('6a90q10',2,this)"><span class="o-idx">1</span> A legacy is only expensive property.<span class="o-gl">❌</span></button>
      <button class="opt" onclick="checkQ('6a90q10',2,this)"><span class="o-idx">2</span> A legacy is something only the leader has.<span class="o-gl">❌</span></button>
      <button class="opt" onclick="checkQ('6a90q10',2,this)"><span class="o-idx">3</span> A legacy is the story and music the next generation remembers.<span class="o-gl">✅</span></button>
      <button class="opt" onclick="checkQ('6a90q10',2,this)"><span class="o-idx">4</span> A legacy is a secret only the members know.<span class="o-gl">❌</span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="p-feedback" id="fb-6a90q10"></div>
  <div class="pt-note"><div class="pt-note-head">🧑‍💻 선생님 노트 · 문제 해설</div><div class="pt-note-body"><div style="margin-bottom:5px;"><b class="hl">그냥 물건이 아니라</b> = "not just a thing, but..." introduces the real definition. A legacy is <b class="hl">다음 세대가 기억하는 우리의 이야기와 음악</b> (the story and music the next generation remembers) — only ③ matches.</div></div></div>
</div>` },
{ "cls": "culture", "html": `<div class="culture">
    <span class="c-label">🎤 K-POP TIP</span>
    <h3>Legacy in K-Pop — Idols Dream of What They Leave Behind</h3>
    <p>Long-running groups often talk about the mark they want to leave — the music, the message, and the fans they hope will carry it forward. That is why idols say "팬분들의 덕에 여기까지 왔어요" (thanks to our fans we've come this far), "좋은 곡을 만들어 냈어요" (we created great songs), and "이 노래는 오래 사랑받을 전망이에요" (this song is expected to be loved for a long time). A legacy is not just trophies — it is the story and songs a group passes to the next generation of listeners.</p>
    <div class="c-tip">✍️ Talk about the mark <i>you</i> want to leave: "팬분들의 덕에 좋은 노래를 만들어 낼 거예요. 우리의 음악이 오래 사랑받을 전망이에요!" (Thanks to the fans, we'll create great songs. Our music is expected to be loved for a long time!) — it sounds exactly like a group dreaming of their lasting legacy!</div>
  </div>` }
